# Paths lychee must not scan. `npm run lint` walks `**/*.md`, which now reaches
# the installed dependency's own README (it ships one with a relative link to a
# file npm does not publish). CI's link job checks out without dependencies, so
# it never sees these; this keeps the local check — and `bump-version.ps1`, which
# runs it — from failing on files we do not own.
node_modules/
